license: "MIT"

abstract: >
  AILEE Trust Layer is deterministic trust-governance middleware for AI systems
  and agentic workflows. It provides confidence-based evaluation, contextual
  grace, peer consensus, fail-safe fallback, policy enforcement, auditable
  decision paths, Local Computing governance, and deterministic mathematical
  evidence for consequential AI-assisted operations.

